{'symbol': 'TECH', 'date': '2022-07-28 07:00:00', 'title': 'BIO-TECHNE ANNOUNCES LICENSING AGREEMENT AND PARTNERSHIP WITH UNIVERSITY OF DUNDEE', 'text': "MINNEAPOLIS AND DUNDEE, SCOTLAND , JULY 28, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BIO-TECHNE CORPORATION (NASDAQ: TECH) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE SIGNING OF AN EXCLUSIVE LICENSING AGREEMENT TO COMMERCIALIZE THE UNIVERSITY OF DUNDEE'S BROMOTAG® SYSTEM AND FUND THE RECRUITMENT OF POSTDOCTORAL RESEARCHERS AT THE UNIVERSITY'S CENTRE FOR TARGETED PROTEIN DEGRADATION (CETPD). CETPD RESEARCHERS WILL CREATE NEW CHEMICAL TOOLS THAT WILL BE COMMERCIALIZED BY TOCRIS, A BIO-TECHNE BRAND, FOR USE BY THE BIOPHARMACEUTICAL RESEARCH COMMUNITY."}